{"k":"stat","t":"Statistics","cls":"11","u":"Probability & Statistics","s":[["Central tendency",[{"q":"Mean","f":"\\bar x=\\frac{\\sum x_i}n,\\qquad\\bar x=\\frac{\\sum f_ix_i}{\\sum f_i}","n":"Step-deviation: $\\bar x=A+\\frac{\\sum f_iu_i}{\\sum f_i}h$, $u_i=\\frac{x_i-A}h$."},{"q":"Combined mean","f":"\\bar x=\\frac{n_1\\bar x_1+n_2\\bar x_2}{n_1+n_2}"},{"q":"Median of grouped data","f":"M=l+\\frac{\\frac N2-C}{f}\\times h"},{"q":"Mode of grouped data","f":"Z=l+\\frac{f_1-f_0}{2f_1-f_0-f_2}\\times h","n":"Empirical: Mode $=3$ Median $-2$ Mean."}]],["Dispersion",[{"q":"Mean deviation","f":"\\text{MD}(a)=\\frac{\\sum|x_i-a|}n","n":"Mean deviation is least about the median."},{"q":"Variance and standard deviation","f":"\\sigma^2=\\frac{\\sum(x_i-\\bar x)^2}n=\\frac{\\sum x_i^2}n-\\bar x^2","n":"Grouped: $\\sigma^2=\\frac{\\sum f_ix_i^2}N-\\bar x^2$; step deviation: $\\sigma^2=h^2\\left[\\frac{\\sum fu^2}N-\\left(\\frac{\\sum fu}N\\right)^2\\right]$."},{"q":"Effect of change of origin and scale","f":"y_i=ax_i+b:\\ \\ \\bar y=a\\bar x+b,\\quad\\sigma_y=|a|\\sigma_x","n":"Variance does not change when a constant is added to every value."},{"q":"Combined variance","f":"\\sigma^2=\\frac{n_1(\\sigma_1^2+d_1^2)+n_2(\\sigma_2^2+d_2^2)}{n_1+n_2},\\quad d_i=\\bar x_i-\\bar x"},{"q":"Coefficient of variation","f":"\\text{CV}=\\frac\\sigma{\\bar x}\\times100","n":"Lower CV means more consistent."}]],["Common results",[{"q":"Variance of first n natural numbers","f":"\\sigma^2=\\frac{n^2-1}{12}","n":"Mean $=\\frac{n+1}2$. For an AP with common difference $d$: $\\sigma^2=\\frac{d^2(n^2-1)}{12}$."},{"q":"Correcting wrong observations","f":"\\text{new }\\sum x=\\text{old}-\\text{wrong}+\\text{correct};\\quad\\text{same for }\\sum x^2"},{"q":"Range of variance","f":"\\sigma^2\\le\\frac{(\\max-\\min)^2}4"},{"q":"Variance of two numbers","f":"\\sigma=\\frac{|a-b|}2"}]]]}